{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": true, "content": "客厅里弥漫着火锅沸腾的氤氲热气，却暖不透角落里凝滞的空气。", "emotion": "angry"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": true, "content": "李萌猛地放下筷子，陶瓷撞在玻璃桌面上发出刺耳的声响。", "emotion": "neutral"}
{"gender": "female", "is_narration": false, "content": "我吃饱了。", "emotion": "neutral"}
{"gender": "female", "is_narration": false, "content": "萌萌，再吃点吧，你最喜欢的虾滑刚煮好。", "emotion": "neutral"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": false, "content": "是啊，有什么事说出来大家一起解决。", "emotion": "calm"}
{"gender": "male", "is_narration": true, "content": "他偷偷瞥了一眼坐在对面的陈浩——后者正低头盯着碗里的蘸料，嘴角紧绷，手中的筷子无意识地搅动着。", "emotion": "neutral"}
{"gender": "female", "is_narration": false, "content": "你们别管她，她就这脾气，一点小事就甩脸。", "emotion": "angry"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": false, "content": "是，我脾气差！那你呢？答应的事哪件做到了？", "emotion": "sad"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": false, "content": "我那不是临时加班吗？", "emotion": "angry"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": false, "content": "每次都是加班！上周末我生日你也加班？", "emotion": "neutral"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": false, "content": "都少说两句……", "emotion": "neutral"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": true, "content": "就在这剑拔弩张的时刻，门铃突然响了。", "emotion": "surprise"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": true, "content": "所有人都愣住了。", "emotion": "surprise"}
{"gender": "female", "is_narration": false, "content": "请问李萌女士在吗？有她的生日蛋糕，送件人陈先生——备注说补上周末的生日惊喜。", "emotion": "surprise"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": true, "content": "客厅里霎时安静，只听见火锅咕嘟咕嘟的翻滚声。", "emotion": "angry"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": false, "content": "本来想等吃完饭再拿出来的……", "emotion": "surprise"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": true, "content": "李萌脸上的怒意如冰雪消融，转而是一种哭笑不得的动容。", "emotion": "angry"}
{"gender": "unknown", "is_narration": false, "content": "你们俩啊……", "emotion": "happy"}
